        <body>
            <div xml:id="d450">

                <pb facs="0754" n="620" sameAs="frus:frus1888p1/pg620"/>

                <head>No. 450.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Pendleton to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-03-12"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 12, 1888</date>.
                        (Received March 26.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 589.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In execution of the telegraphic instruction
                    of the President received from you the 10th instant, I had the honor to address
                    at once to Count Bismarck a note of which within is a copy. This morning I
                    received a reply dated the 10th instant, of which I send also copy of the
                    original and translation.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Geo. H.
                    Pendleton.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d450-a1.xml" xpointer="d450-a1"/>
